  'Прогнозата за теглото — по Hall 2011. ': 'Weight forecast per Hall 2011. ',
  'Тренировките — по СЗО 2020, 2024 Adult Compendium of Physical Activities и ACSM; крачките — по Paluch 2022 и Ding 2025. ': 'Training per WHO 2020, the 2024 Adult Compendium of Physical Activities and ACSM; steps per Paluch 2022 and Ding 2025. ',
